This file should be replaced with the actual domain association file
downloaded from the Omise Dashboard or Apple Developer Portal.

Steps:
1. Log in to Omise Dashboard → Settings → Apple Pay
2. Add your domain and download the domain association file
3. Replace this file's contents with the downloaded file
4. The file must be accessible at:
   https://yourdomain.com/.well-known/apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association
